{"parse": {"title": "谋杀始于清晨-09", "pageid": 110543, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-08\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">谋杀始于清晨-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-10\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">谋杀始于清晨</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A1.8C.E4.BA.8E.E5.B0.8F.E5.BE.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"行于小径\">行于小径</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 行于小径</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Run</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杳无人烟的乡村小道上，一道身影快速行进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>披风将她紧紧裹着，肩背上还残留着些许枯枝落叶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大自然是她最好的伪装，帮助她几次成功逃过宪兵队的追捕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>两年没回来了……感谢天主，幸好这里还和从前一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>日夜的不眠不休让玛丽安娜以最快速度回到了家乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站在熟悉但紧闭的大门前，略显迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>门把和台阶上都是灰尘，似乎很久没有人进出了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这是怎么回事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我把他们都接走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>谁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜转身的同时端起枪，枪口不偏不倚地对准了来人的胸口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>看来我们确实太久没见，你连我的声音都忘了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>拉蒂斯？你怎么会在这儿？你应该还在前线才是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>族人平安无事，我让他们搬去了更安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我听说了兵变和处决的事，以为不会再见到你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……如你所见，我做了逃兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜避开了拉蒂斯的视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>唔……天主降下的厄运之中，石像鬼确实不应参与。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>堂兄的回答令人意外，她不解地看向眼前久违而陌生的哥哥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战争将他洗练得沧桑而漠然，如同所有士兵那样，然而自他身上还诞生出一种古怪的执着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你的话是什么意思？等等……你要去哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你怎么知道我在这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯转身离开的动作并未停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我也是石像鬼，发现你不是难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>跟上来吧，你不想见她吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>没错，我们最亲爱的妹妹，艾格尼丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的沉默中，二人一前一后地走向艾格尼丝的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>艾格尼丝在家吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>她怎么没和你一起出来？她受伤了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-526011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-526011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-526011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>呵，她果然没告诉你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯停了下来，转过头不无讽刺地审视着玛丽安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……她说过，她在接济因战争无家可归的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>是啊，这就是我们之中最圣洁的教徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>慷慨、仁慈、心怀怜悯，无论是对陌生人，还是对血亲之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>……她并非是在这里接济，她去了阿尔芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>只因远方支脉一封写满哀求与绝望的信，她带着一大笔钱，去到了未来被战争波及的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>而她害怕你在前线为她担心，好心地隐去了地点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>不可能……她不会撒谎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你对她的了解依旧如此……浅薄，就像你对信仰的理解一样。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯打开门，客厅中央一座石像鬼雕像静立着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是她妹妹的石像，永恒定格着她哭泣的姿态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>艾格尼丝？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急忙赶上前去，跪在石像前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>快醒来，我是玛丽，我回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>石像纹丝不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>怎么回事……为什么她没有苏醒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>她不会醒来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>如果你没有忘记自己血统的力量，那你应该知道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>石像鬼想要从石化中苏醒，得为自己留下最后一块血肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你虽然从来没有用心钻研过我们的天赋，但身处战场，求生的本能会帮你做出正确的抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>但艾格尼丝不一样，她选择全身石化，迎接天启。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……艾格尼丝到底遭遇了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我从来没有见过她如此恐惧的样子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……难道那时候的幻象就是来自神的警告吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>怎样……才能让艾格尼丝醒来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现实与幻象重合，唤起了她难以逃避的恐惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>止不住的颤栗与惊慌如附骨之疽，又一次把控了她的身躯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>堂亲，你还不明白吗？肮脏的战争还没有让你愚钝的双眼看清一切吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜抵御着眩晕的侵袭，吃力地看着拉蒂斯张开双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>世人愚蠢却不自知！自寻堕落地将工具理性奉为真知灼见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>攻讦欺瞒、彼此算计，所谓“进步”与“自由”全是为了宣泄丑恶欲望与卑劣人性的遮羞布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>神从来没有想要遗弃我们，但他也确实失望至极——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>这场不休的战争，就是天父施下的惩罚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>那……艾格尼丝……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>但你千万不可埋怨神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯自顾自说着，蹲下身，用力抓住玛丽安娜的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>目睹艾格尼丝的石化，我领悟了神的安排——石像鬼不该参与这场战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>这场浩劫正在涤净这个世界，信念会重获新生，人子将在治死的肉体里真正复苏——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>战后，我们要重建世界，一个回归信仰、具有古典之优雅的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>石像鬼世代以恶魔的姿态彰显神的威严，以污秽守护圣洁，届时要靠我们带领所有人归于神！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯的双眼迸发出狂烈的光芒，几乎要将玛丽安娜灼伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>所以我们不该继续投身这场灾厄，石像鬼的使命并不在此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……你也是逃兵，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你该从庸俗的规则之中解放了，唯有神的指示才是我们该遵从的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>在纯净的世界里，得到了神的宽恕与爱，艾格尼丝就能重回我们身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你明白吗，堂亲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜难以理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但唯有一句话在玛丽安娜濒临崩溃的世界里留下了寸土的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>战争结束……艾格尼丝，就会回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>只要战争结束……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人的教堂里，玛丽安娜正给石像鬼雕塑拂去尘埃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这座距离村庄不远的教堂，成为了玛丽安娜与拉蒂斯躲避追捕的避难所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我们的家并不安全，只能让你和我们一起奔波逃离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>但这里至少还能让你感受神的光辉，希望你能因此谅解我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我会时刻祈祷战争的结束，尽快让你回到我们身边，望神还愿聆听罪人的祷告……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……对家族血统的理解，我没有你和拉蒂斯深刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>但他的笃定一定有我暂时未能理解的道理，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝手捂着面容，她无法再回答姐姐的问题了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "谋杀始于清晨-09"}}